<title>SINGAPORE: S'pore electronics sector shrinks 10.3 pct Q1 97.</title>
<headline>S'pore electronics sector shrinks 10.3 pct Q1 97.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's elecronics sector shrank by 10.3 percent in the first quarter of 1997 year-on-year, the Ministry of Trade and Industry (MTI) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
